[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5029237163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121485#issuecomment-5029237163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121485","id":5029237163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK8QRqw","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T01:39:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T01:39:40Z","body":"Can reproduce on Android.\nIt looks like only the shortcuts that are only in the menu are not working, other shortcuts like undo are also handled in TextEdit or other places.\nIt also happens with other shortcuts like `ctrl+n` for new script, `ctrl+f` to find, or `alt+left` for history go back.\n\n- Probably caused by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112766 \nIt hides the menu bar when the keyboard is open, which likely prevents the shortcuts from working.\n\nMaybe instead of hiding the menu bar entirely we could move it somewhere instead?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5029237163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5029361419","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121485#issuecomment-5029361419","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121485","id":5029361419,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK8X3Cw","user":{"login":"moostafa-afk","id":190646012,"node_id":"U_kgDOC10G_A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190646012?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moostafa-afk","html_url":"https://github.com/moostafa-afk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moostafa-afk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moostafa-afk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moostafa-afk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moostafa-afk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moostafa-afk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moostafa-afk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moostafa-afk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moostafa-afk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moostafa-afk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T01:59:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T01:59:10Z","body":"I think this happened even before that, since the earliest version of this problem was in Godot 4.6 which released a while back. But good observation on your part about the CTR + N shortcut, it only works when the script editor is in landscape, but in portrait mode it doesn't, which makes me suspect that different shortcuts aren't working for different reasons.\n\nCTR + N : has something to do with the Top Menu Bar being available.\n\nBut for the other shortcuts that doe